              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "More open, as Claude desktop opens its menu from the foot of the sidebar: Agents, Review (2 to review), Logs, Vault, Extensions, Usage, Brain, then Settings and What's New, with a dot while there is news. More carries the same dot when the menu is closed.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
