              "content": "ORCHESTRATOR-PER-CHAT.md v2.2: the fixed number per chat (4.1 and 7.3), the count of working chats against the limit computed from the Mac's RAM (4.2), and a chat's state from its runner, asleep, idle or running, with unread and a permission ask (4.5).",
