          "content": "With no project folder and no document, each list says where things will come from. A save that fails says why, where it happened, and keeps what you typed. A file an agent changed while you edit it is never overwritten without asking. A file that is not text, or too long to edit, says so.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
