          "type": "text",
          "id": "Xi7ut",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "content": "Connectors · add a server: a URL, installing into each CLI, a command not found, a secret missing, one CLI that failed, an agent's scope",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "EZlSQ",
          "name": "intro",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1100,
          "content": "Add writes the server into every CLI's own configuration at once, for the scope picked, and says for each CLI how it went. Secrets stay with Tars and reach the server when it starts. A failure for one CLI leaves the others with the server and says which one to retry.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
