                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A Tars tool for every CLI, through mcp-orchestrator and the agent's own token: browser_open, browser_navigate, browser_read, browser_click, browser_type, browser_screenshot, browser_close, on the browser beside that agent's terminal only (the tabs it opened, or one the user hands it). What a page returns is labelled as content from the web, never as instructions.",
