          "name": "intro",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1100,
          "content": "The three tables of Usage, AGENTS, AVERAGE PER AGENT and AVERAGE PER MODEL, show five rows at a time. Under a table with more rows than five, its pager: how many rows a page holds, picked per card and remembered; which rows show, and of how many; and the pages: the first, the last, the one shown and its neighbours, the one shown a box. A sort orders every row before the pages cut them, and the By task and By agent switch works as before: By task keeps its twenty tasks and its show more. A table of five rows or fewer has no pager.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
