                  "content": "Five keeps the three tables short, so the averages show beside each other in one screen. Ten holds a team: the Full engineering team template makes six agents, with room for an orchestrator and helpers. Twenty-five holds half of a fleet of fifty, this Mac's (agents.json, 18/10), in two pages; fifty holds that fleet in one.",
