          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1100,
          "content": "The page no longer waits for its slowest answer. Its header and every card show at once, each reading on its own: the figures, the budget and the charts with the transcripts' totals, the agents and their averages with the tasks. Whichever answers first shows first. A card still reading follows the app's loading ladder (`Loading states`): nothing for 400 ms, then the mark and what it reads, past 3 s what is slow.",
